e thermal equipment tracked the thermally elevated object, and official documents included images depicting the craft superimposed over the landscape. </li><li>The redacted files were disclosed as part of a document release after <a href=\"https://www.independent.co.uk/topic/donald-trump\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Donald Trump</a> directed his administration to disclose information regarding mysterious aerial objects. </li></ul><figure><figcaption>In full</figcaption><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.independent.co.uk/news/world/americas/pentagon-ufo-files-triangles-us-trump-b3072621.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><h3>New Pentagon UFO files reveal mystery ‘black triangle’ over sensitive US site</h3><p><img src=\"https://static.independent.co.uk/2026/10/24/8/54/Screenshot-2026-10-24-at-09-09-18.png?quality=75&amp;width=83&amp;auto=webp%2083w\" alt=\"New Pentagon UFO files reveal mystery ‘black triangle’ over sensitive US site\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p></a></li></ul></figure><p>More bulletins</p><h3>Thank you for registering</h3><p>Please refresh the page or navigate to another page on the site to be automatically logged inPlease refresh your browser to be logged in</p>"
